//- The highlight strip on the home (§S11.3, `blog.highlight_tag`): the
//- pictures of the newest six posts whose frontmatter `tags` contain the
//- tag, as a contact sheet; the heading is the tag itself. Each frame links
//- its post (the title is the link's text, hidden behind the picture). Not
//- rendered when no post has the tag.
if themeUmwege.highlightPosts(pageLang({ meta })).length
    section.home-highlight
        h2= themeUmwege.highlightTag()
        ol
            each item in themeUmwege.highlightPosts(pageLang({ meta }))
                li
                    a(href=item.meta.href)
                        if item.meta.image
                            include card-media.pug
                        span= item.meta.title
